{"id":"n59288-1-9","stage":3,"title":"부츠 · 靴子","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59288-1-9-1","ko":"눈이 많이 쌓여서 그냥 구두를 신고 나가면 발이 다 젖겠더라.","zh":"雪堆得这么厚，要是直接穿皮鞋出门的话，脚肯定会被弄湿的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈이","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈이","audio":"/audio/6f2474549eb981a98228.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"쌓여서","meaning":"堆，叠放，堆积","explanation":"쌓이다：堆，叠放，堆积；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쌓이다","audio":"/audio/a3671bf3560526d3e4f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65098","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌓이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌓여서","audio":"/audio/9b594471d9eec9c0f79f.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"구두를","meaning":"皮鞋","explanation":"구두：皮鞋；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"구두","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26805","senseId":"1","lemma":"구두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구두를","audio":"/audio/e62d8606ca23652b0529.mp3"}},{"text":"신고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"신다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"신다","audio":"/audio/cfdd828384c45d2301f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17192","senseId":"1","lemma":"신다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신고","audio":"/audio/bbb56c63d872d9a1b381.mp3"}},{"text":"나가면","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가면","audio":"/audio/0a8a332b019454ae6b54.mp3"}},{"text":"발이","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발이","audio":"/audio/3a92a3501453356f42c0.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"젖겠더라.","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젖겠더라","audio":"/audio/8ae705cbce4f602818cf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"a3671bf3560526d3","term":"쌓이다","zh":"堆，叠放，堆积","audio":"/audio/a3671bf3560526d3e4f3.mp3","entryId":"65098","definition":"多个东西被层层撂着。","pronunciation":["싸이다"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"0053d9a290561503","term":"구두","zh":"皮鞋","audio":"/audio/0053d9a2905615031142.mp3","entryId":"26805","definition":"穿正装时所穿的由皮革、塑料等制成的鞋。","pronunciation":["구두"]},{"id":"cfdd828384c45d23","term":"신다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/cfdd828384c45d2301f0.mp3","entryId":"17192","definition":"把脚放进鞋子或袜子等里面，覆盖脚的全部或一部分。","pronunciation":["신ː따"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5f61a84f921197b6","term":"젖다","zh":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3","entryId":"64729","definition":"液体渗入，变得潮湿。","pronunciation":["젇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b0f06da4e0151ca7269.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59288-1-9-2","ko":"네, 그럼 부츠를 신고 나갈게요.","zh":"好的，那我就会穿靴子出门。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"부츠를","meaning":"靴子","explanation":"부츠：靴子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"부츠","audio":"/audio/7e4763cd26116a165ae9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59288","senseId":"1","lemma":"부츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부츠를","audio":"/audio/43b882f4a94e17726821.mp3"}},{"text":"신고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"신다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"신다","audio":"/audio/cfdd828384c45d2301f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17192","senseId":"1","lemma":"신다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신고","audio":"/audio/bbb56c63d872d9a1b381.mp3"}},{"text":"나갈게요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나갈게요","audio":"/audio/fda95e8eb20d314960c1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"7e4763cd26116a16","term":"부츠","zh":"靴子","audio":"/audio/7e4763cd26116a165ae9.mp3","entryId":"59288","definition":"鞋帮高到脚踝、小腿或膝盖以上的皮鞋。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"cfdd828384c45d23","term":"신다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/cfdd828384c45d2301f0.mp3","entryId":"17192","definition":"把脚放进鞋子或袜子等里面，覆盖脚的全部或一部分。","pronunciation":["신ː따"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/15f65890aaa95806f0e7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.205,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59288","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，那我就会穿靴子出门。","雪堆得这么厚，要是直接穿皮鞋出门的话，脚肯定会被弄湿的。","假期里我不仅去旅行回来了，还做了志愿者，还学习了英语。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["雪堆得这么厚，要是直接穿皮鞋出门的话，脚肯定会被弄湿的。","假期里我不仅去旅行回来了，还做了志愿者，还学习了英语。","好的，那我就会穿靴子出门。"],"answer":2}]}
